  m_Text: "Game Rules \r\nGoal of Victory\r\nEat all the fruit.\r\n\rGame Rules\r\nThere
    is only one guide (you, the animal). Follow the gold standard.\r\n\rIf you hit
    a small obstacle, your life will be lowered. When your life is over, you lose
    the game.\r\n\rLevels\r\nThere are 3 levels.\r\n\rFinal Message\r\nWhen you wear
    your bravery and believe in the unknown forest \u2014 congratulations and have
    fun!"
